# ~/.config/univim/vn_macros
# format: key:text  (one shortcut per line, plain UTF-8, no header needed --
# univim generates the internal libunikey header for you)
#
# Uncomment and edit, then restart univim to pick up changes:
#
# sdt:số điện thoại
# vn:Việt Nam
#
# Typing the key followed by a word-break key (space, punctuation, ...)
# expands it in place. A key only matches as a whole word -- typing it as
# part of a longer word (e.g. "xsdt") does not trigger expansion.
